**Assignment Title** Studio 1.1
**Prompt** The Poster Pitch
Assignment title: Visual Prompt Phase 1.1
Prompt: Create a poster of a science fiction blockbuster that features the landscape of an abandoned mall in the middle of a small town that displays aliens and spaceships the aliens and spaceships should be enlarged, three dimensional ovals with thin vertical lines coming out from the bottom of the ovals they should be seen as over taking the town and show the space ships standing directly over the mall, show the humans watching from a distance make the humans much smaller than the aliens and spaceships to show the power dynamic. The city should resemble a small town with not many buildings the shopping mall should be the biggest building in the town the lines on the shopping mall should be large with horizontal and vertical lines that turn into dark contour lines. The focus of the composition is on the aliens and ships that are over taking the town giving an ominous a lonely feeling and the humans watching from a distance in fear. The city feels metallic with the spaceships but also rough and rocky due to aliens coming and landing on the town destroying home and landscape the contrast of the aliens and spaceships overtaking the town should be a dark red with balk, the humans watching from a far distance should be a warmer tone of blue and grey to show sadness and fear. 
Vocabulary Breakdown Contour lines: Edge or Profile of an object, can help give volume in a space. 
Shape: can be geometric and organic, boundaries of shapes are defined by lines or suggested by changes in color or value.
Color: can be warm or light help set a mood for the art work. 
Three-dimensional: unlike two dimensional this has height, width, and depth. 
**Reflection Link** You will add the link to the audio file (or add a comment mentioning that your reflection photos are in the folder)


